    "title": "FRAYT Driver",
    "description": "The Official Driver App for FRAYT\r\n\r\nRun with the best, earn good money on the side, and control your schedule. \r\n\r\nFRAYT is an on-demand delivery app that allows independent contractors to work for themselves on their own schedule. Apply to be a driver in the app today, and when approved you can start taking deliveries and making money.\r\n\r\n* Get paid fast (within 12-14 hours) and manage your income, all in one app\r\n* All vehicle sizes - from car to cargo van (and box trucks in certain markets)\r\n* Flexible hours - when you work is always up to you\r\n* Receive notifications on new delivery offers in your area\r\n* View all current, upcoming, and past delivery opportunities in app\r\n* We\u2019re here for you - 24/7 on-call support team and knowledge base",
